{"id":"79b32ea25a3ad603","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-bombieri-vinogradov.md","title":"Bombieri–Vinogradov Estimate","display":"df-bombieri-vinogradov — Bombieri–Vinogradov Estimate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bombieri-vinogradov","aliases":["58-df-bombieri-vinogradov"],"display":"df-bombieri-vinogradov — Bombieri–Vinogradov Estimate","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bombieri-vinogradov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bombieri-vinogradov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bombieri-vinogradov — Bombieri–Vinogradov Estimate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md\">../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (任意误差指数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in q\">\\(a\\in q\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (素数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (自然数整除谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md\">../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(x;q,a)\">\\(\\psi(x;q,a)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(q)\">\\(\\varphi(q)\\)</span> (本文件中的局部算术函数缩写)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\\)</span> (本文件定义的估计命题)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov\\text{-}totient}\\vdash\n\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq\\left|\\left\\{b\\in q:\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Div}(d,b)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,q)\\to d=1\\bigr)\\right\\}\\right|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov\\text{-}totient}\\vdash\n\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq\\left|\\left\\{b\\in q:\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Div}(d,b)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,q)\\to d=1\\bigr)\\right\\}\\right|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov\\text{-}chebyshev}\\vdash\n\\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\omega,\\ k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p),\\ p^k\\leq x\\\\\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(p^k=a+jq)}}\\log p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov\\text{-}chebyshev}\\vdash\n\\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\omega,\\ k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p),\\ p^k\\leq x\\\\\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(p^k=a+jq)}}\\log p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\exists B,C,x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\geq x_0\\;\\left(\n\\sum_{\\substack{q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\q\\leq x^{1/2}(\\log x)^{-B}}}\n\\max_{\\substack{a\\in q\\\\\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Div}(d,a)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,q)\\to d=1)}}\n\\left|\\psi(x;q,a)-\\frac{x}{\\varphi(q)}\\right|\n\\leq C\\frac{x}{(\\log x)^A}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\exists B,C,x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\geq x_0\\;\\left(\n\\sum_{\\substack{q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\q\\leq x^{1/2}(\\log x)^{-B}}}\n\\max_{\\substack{a\\in q\\\\\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Div}(d,a)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,q)\\to d=1)}}\n\\left|\\psi(x;q,a)-\\frac{x}{\\varphi(q)}\\right|\n\\leq C\\frac{x}{(\\log x)^A}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bombieri–Vinogradov is an &quot;RH on average&quot; result.</li>\n<li>定理断言为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A&gt;0\\;\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\">\\(\\forall A&gt;0\\;\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\\)</span>；这里仅定义其参数化估计命题。</li>\n<li>Key for Goldbach, almost primes in progressions.</li>\n<li>删除了原文件中并非 Bombieri–Vinogradov 结论的逐个模数估计，并把错误的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^2/(\\log x)^A\">\\(x^2/(\\log x)^A\\)</span> 修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x/(\\log x)^A\">\\(x/(\\log x)^A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V$ (素数谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}\\subseteq V^2$ (自然数整除谓词, see [[../batch05/58-df-divisibility.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(x;q,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov\\text{-}totient}\\vdash\n\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq\\left|\\left\\{b\\in q:\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Div}(d,b)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,q)\\to d=1\\bigr)\\right\\}\\right|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov\\text{-}chebyshev}\\vdash\n\\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\omega,\\ k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p),\\ p^k\\leq x\\\\\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(p^k=a+jq)}}\\log p","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bombieri\\text{-}vinogradov}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land\n\\exists B,C,x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x\\geq x_0\\;\\left(\n\\sum_{\\substack{q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\q\\leq x^{1/2}(\\log x)^{-B}}}\n\\max_{\\substack{a\\in q\\\\\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Div}(d,a)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,q)\\to d=1)}}\n\\left|\\psi(x;q,a)-\\frac{x}{\\varphi(q)}\\right|\n\\leq C\\frac{x}{(\\log x)^A}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A>0\\;\\mathrm{BombieriVinogradov}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"x^2/(\\log x)^A","display":false},{"tex":"x/(\\log x)^A","display":false}],"bytes":2079,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-bombieri-vinogradov.md|58-df-bombieri-vinogradov]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["dad686059f3ca152","b932045a4446f26a"]}